{
  "scope": "Controlled PAC execution of unchanged self-contained Darwin explicit scalar, 128-bit integer, direct record/HFA and indirect aggregate pointer calls. Includes register exhaustion, packed fixed stack placement, whole aligned variadic values, and exact original indirect parameter pointer transport. Indirect pointer contents and storage writes require separate native fixtures. Supplied prototypes, not automatic complete recovery. Every invalid signature must retain the original exception class at every optimization route; no intermediate-resign exception allowance. Hidden results, authenticated whole images, native Apple PAC execution, signed exception unwinding and exact fault PC/ESR remain unqualified.",
